Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lay a finger on those\Ndice, Josuke Higashikata!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would stay put if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he's gonna do if he finds\Nout I've been cheating this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say a simple apology\Nwon't be enough to smooth things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be my mind playing tricks, but\NI could swear the dice are staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate, let's\Nget back to the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.52,0:00:47.77,Episode 28 Typesetting 2,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,664)\fad(318,1)}Rohan... Adds 30 New Chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're way braver than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll just be two for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch my drift now, Mr. Alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.56,0:01:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the point is to come out on top,\Nbut I only have to do that by a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like what I'm saying is going\Nin one ear and out the other!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that's what you\Ncall a streak of luck, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolling that score again isn't impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An omen is worth five\Ntimes the initial bet, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.38,0:01:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dice will roll as they may.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can never predict these\Nkinds of things, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's break down, break down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's break down, break down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break down, break down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
