Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.25,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 28: {\fs80} Highway Star, Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.25,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(142,900)\fs60}Episode 28: {\fs80} Highway Star Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're insufferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, for Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Koichi's sakes, I've been\Nkeeping my cool where you're concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheating me crosses every line ever drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've been gloating this entire\Ntime, and the thought of it makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.84,0:03:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have Shining Diamond fix it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea why I\Ndid that to my little finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can't back out of the game\Nlike a coward, Josuke Higashkata!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a pea-brained dullard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let you\Ndisrespect the Great Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:02.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each of us is going to have one more turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as we play, I'll find a way to\Nsee through your immoral deceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I fail to uncover the truth\Nbehind your clandestine tactics,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here's two million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it monetary incentive to receive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,treatment from Shining\NDiamond after the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if I do unveil the\Nnature of your deception,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little finger will belong\Nto me, Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.97,0:04:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you two are having\Na rip-snortin' good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo! Josuke! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been stuck in that stupid\Nhospital for a month now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still kind of fuzzy on the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm told I conked my\Nnoggin on the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tamami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you poking\Nyour nose around here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hired him to be a repo man\Nof sorts, just as a precaution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repo man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:05:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you boys waiting,\Nbut I'm here and ready to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not to worry, I'm prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My trusty solar fixing lock will\Nensure you receive what we agreed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fulfill my duty regardless of\Nwho the victor is, you have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.94,0:05:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fees, whichever is the\Ngreatest, Quee or 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll both play one more round,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while Rohan tries to figure out how\Nyou're cheating him, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a chance you could be\Ntempted to withhold your trick,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I will simply ensure that you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should you win without\Nyour usual deceptions,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tamami's lock will activate and\Nautomatically attach itself to your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really up shit creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to pull off this trick\Nand get myself out of this mess
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're clear, I'll roll first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A four!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two threes and a four
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God a normal result for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't figure it out now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, it's my turn now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like a weight's been\Nlifted off your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost as though a task you\Nrequested if someone was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan still doesn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.98,0:06:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that barf?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh shit, he's getting dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's because Rohan\Nwas shaking him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I insist you stop covering the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see them if they're\Nin your hand like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shake the dice with your palm open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be a fire somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:06:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sirens?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's allergic to the sound of sirens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he'll revert back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your stalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what you're holding in your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just heard the way I get\Nmyself hyped up for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get ready to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a 6-6-6 Hamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the lock didn't activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke's a low-down rotten cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you figure it out, Rohan-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does your silence mean\Nyou throw it in the towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like those weird little\Ndots aren't on Rohan's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't leave us here in suspense!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you figure it out or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it all makes sense\NDamn, I'm toast I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fire's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.98,0:08:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Sensei, your house\Nis burning to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the magnifying glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sunlight went through\Nit and started the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were distracted and didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if the house\Nends up in a heap of ash All
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that matters here is figuring\Nout how Josuke's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take your two million\Nand get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before I go, I'll\Nfix that finger of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't just heal\Npeople without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.82,0:08:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the kind of guy that\Nsome people just love to hate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would've figured?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem displeased.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, was I of adequate\Nassistance to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you like... Shut up! Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe's house.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.23,0:09:15.24,Episode 28 Typesetting 2,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs(50)\an2\fad(233,0)\pos(960,510)}Kishibe Rohan's house: Received 7,000,000 yen's worth of fire damage. {Matches sign}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.23,0:09:15.24,Episode 28 Typesetting 2,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs(50)\fad(233,0)\pos(960,572)}Josuke: Though not losing anything in particular,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.23,0:09:15.24,Episode 28 Typesetting 2,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs(50)\fad(233,0)\pos(960,620)}managed to make Rohan's grudge against him even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half burned and seven\Nmillion yen in fire damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke may have escaped unscathed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he managed to find himself\Neven further on Rohan's bad side.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\p1\be0.3\1c&H8CB3DA&\pos(815.714,633.142)\be(6)}m 0 -10 l 480 10 480 270 0 290{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fry3.93\frx0.02\fax0.02\frz359.1\pos(690.8,405)}Kawajiri
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(942,411)\be(0.1)\fry4.16\frx0.03\frz-1.26\fax0.03}Kosaku
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(948,501)\be(0.1)\fry4.16\frx0.03\frz-0.06}Shinobu
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(942,587)\be(0.1)\fry4.16\frx0.03\frz1.08\fax-0.02}Hayato
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(690,409)\be(0.1)}Kawajiri
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(942,411)\be(0.1)}Kosaku
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(948,501)\be(0.1)}Shinobu
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.16,Episode 28 Typesetting 3,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(942,587)\be(0.1)}Hayato
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a friendly reminder\Nto all you drivers out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there to be extra careful\Nwhen you're on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems a motorcycle crashed at the\Nentrance of Futatsumori Tunnel yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the young rider was badly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Police later discovered\Nthat the accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom's been acting different lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been dressing up,\Nwearing new lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting mom doesn't usually get\Nnaked in front of dad not in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wonder if I was born to\Nparents with no love for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, the guy's guitar, Jotaro, Kujo,\Nthey're the reason I'm in this predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Josuke, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey man, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.64,0:10:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did you find a place to\Nsleep and get a bite to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikitaka! Mikitaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your hiney over here this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't been in town that long,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there are lots of errands\Nto be done, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course. Sorry, Mother.\NI'm coming. Huh? Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, for Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling people\Nthat you're an alien again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I told you about\Nplaying these pranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do apologize if my\Nboy has been a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They actually took him seriously\Nat his school in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have seen the ruckus he caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brainwashed her, isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as she knows, I'm her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikitaka Hazekura is my alias\Nwhile I'm here on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikitaka, it's time to go!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.82,0:11:24.28,Episode 28 Typesetting 1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,870)\fad(238,1)}Hazekura Mikitaka... Alien or Stand User??
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who the devil was that armball?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he serious about being an alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was he simply a stand user I created\Nwhen I threw the arrow and cut his neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way that boy was able\Nto drive a wedge between
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and Rohan was\Ncertainly a sight of the hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, he's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next they'll face the stand, Highway Kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll crush whoever hunts my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you just going to ignore me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The least you could do is say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's common courtesy to address those\Nolder than you, Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, that fire was\Ncrazy, wasn't it? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was approximately 2.5\Nmillion yen worth of furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pieces were used in the\Nmovie Pretty Woman, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.10,0:12:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that any of that bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I'll repay you for\Nyesterday's game one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:12:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a door to a\Nhouse in the tunnel wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a room beyond these tunnel walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from what I can see,\Nsomeone's living in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a man, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't see their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he attempting to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, tell me you saw that. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think you can screw with me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else can see the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that house a new stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man who cut off that woman's\Nhand, could he be Yoshikage Kira?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.93,0:13:59.94,Episode 10 Typesetting 1back,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(1155.714,63.142)\be0.3}m 0 0 l 800 0 800 1000 0 1000{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.93,0:13:59.94,Episode 10 Typesetting 1a,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,120)}Morioh Landmark #8
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.93,0:13:59.94,Episode 10 Typesetting 1b,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,210)}Twin Forest Tunnel
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.93,0:13:59.94,Episode 10 Typesetting 1c,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,650)\fs59}- Completed in year five \Nof the Kaei Era (1852). \N- Rennovated in year twenty-eight \Nof the Showa Period (1953). \N- 450 meters in length. \N- Connects the road between \NS city and Morioh.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.93,0:13:59.94,Episode 10 Typesetting 1d,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,1000)\fs51}Because it curves inside, the exit is \Nnot visible from the entrance. Due to\N the lack of light, many accidents have\N occurred inside. As a result, \Nyoung people commonly believe \Nit to be haunted.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.90,0:14:09.70,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Twin Forest Tunnel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect me to believe there\Nwas a room inside the tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not fooling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that half-baked lie your\Nway of getting back at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have no faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rich coming from\Na cheater like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not only are you a cheater, you're\Na cheater who lies to cover his tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the gall to accuse me of lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I should have known we\Nwould never see eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand even if\NI took you back there to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exit...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn there was\Nsomething, but it's just a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it was an illusion.
