Dialogue: 2,0:15:21.27,0:15:21.31,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=21}{\blur0.9\bord0\fscx130.02\fscy108.35\frz12.77\pos(377.1,621.1)\4a&HFF&}T{*\c&H1D60CC&}u{*\c&H1F60CA&}m{*\c&H2060C9&}b{*\c&H2260C7&}l{\c&H2360C5&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the room I saw from the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just appeared out of thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what happened to the man\Nand woman who were in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This room is a trap and I fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever's in there is getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see a thing,\Nbut something is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that wouldn't have ended\Nwell it was totally
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,invisible but something was moving toward
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me something non-human that room was bait\Nand the cure-looking Fool was an illusion
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no doubt in my\Nmind that room is a stand
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going it alone is risky\Ni should tell mr joestar
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look just like living footprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are they so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got away, so it can't run faster\Nthan 60 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long-range stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It caught up to me, but I only\Nlowered my speed by a fraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:16:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it a book and take\Ncontrol with Heaven's Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sopping my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping I'd never have to see\NRohan's smug face again, but here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may think I'm a dumb liar, but\Nhe'll see that I have a heart too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where the heck is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Rohan's motorcycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd it just fly out of the tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where's Rohan?
