Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.32,0:17:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Utterly delectable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shall become my nourishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven! Heaven's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stand's name is Highway Kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That room was his trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hunts down anyone who enters the room.
