Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it pursues them like a rabid dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it finally catches them, it\Ndrains them of all their nutrients.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Highway Kick is able to touch\Nyou, its weakness disappears?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.30,0:18:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My strength is fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even read.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's depleting more and\Nmore of my strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raiding in a command is impossible now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Rohan! You here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you actually came back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a friend. How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan, I believe he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey Rohan answer me come
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on Rohan wait
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that what
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:19:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Rohan well go ahead\Ncall your friend over so he
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can rescue you shout out\Nfor help do it there's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing stopping you I've\Nleft a fraction of your body's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nutrients behind if you\Nagree to call out for his
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assistance i might be kind\Nenough to spare your life i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,simply go after him instead\Nof sucking you dry now then
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.98,0:19:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't you make this easy\Nfor everyone and lure him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the room you want to\Nlive don't you all you need
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do is get him to walk\Ninside what the hell is this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place if i didn't know any\Nbetter i'd say someone lives
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here hurry and open your\Nmouth before it's too late
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you don't act now he's\Nlikely to walk away it's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not as if you two actually\Ncare about each other right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,last chance ask him to save\Nyou maybe you want to die
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if if i bait him into coming\Nif i hand him over to you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will will you really keep your promise and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spare my life i need to\Nhear you say the words
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but of course i give you my word if\Nyou hold up your end of our arrangement
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no harm will come to you now speak
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bring me my meal sorry but i refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what you should know that one of rohan\Nkishibe's favorite pastimes is saying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no to fools who think they're tough\Nshit so i'm afraid your meal's been
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, you\Ncan't come in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, you're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.79,0:20:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't know me at all, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not one to sit back\Nand do as I'm told.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let me at this dickwad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His ass is grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where he's hiding and I'll get to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.28,0:21:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work, what didn't you\Nhear a single word I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just told you he's deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always do the exact\Nopposite of what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I despise you\Nwith a burning passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you bugged the out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to attack you, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already let him\Ngrab hold of your scent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last time to eat heaven's door?
