Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.60,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: My body will fly backwards at seventy kilometers per hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Njousuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.71,0:21:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highway Kick will follow you anywhere\Nat a speed of 60 kilometers per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to find the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your only way out of this predicament\Nis to defeat the thing's user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.76,0:21:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't shut up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bad habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:22:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan went out of his way to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting all choked up over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.10,0:22:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.86,0:22:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.66,0:22:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said all I had to\Ndo was find its user.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll do much more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pummel his soul-sucking ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Rohan!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.93,0:22:53.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.98,0:22:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any time I need to see your\Nface it has closed my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.31,0:22:55.56,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am taken to a place\Nwhere you're crystal mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.56,0:22:58.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a gentle feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:22:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a shelter in the face of my spine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.35,0:23:00.02,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:22:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight like a Chaka cherry cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to explain.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.40,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.40,0:23:04.77,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'ma move so slightly To the arms and\Nthe lips and the face To the humic
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.77,0:23:07.57,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the ball that I need to I want to\NCome and stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.57,0:23:09.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.28,0:23:11.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.53,0:23:13.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you When I get to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.87,0:23:15.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.49,0:23:18.12,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I want you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.12,0:23:22.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ooh, I got it by now.
